      "options": {
        "content": "## TravelTrust API — Onboarding HTTP (example)\n\n- **Counters**: **`traveltrust_onboarding_http_responses_total{route,status_class}`** (2xx / 4xx / 5xx coarse) and **`traveltrust_onboarding_*_requests_total`** from **`GET /metrics`** (see **`crates/api/src/routes/health_meta/handlers.rs`**).\n- **Webhook queue / DLQ**: **`traveltrust_onboarding_webhook_jobs_pending`**; **`traveltrust_onboarding_webhook_dlq_unreplayed`** (actionable **`replayed_at IS NULL`**); **`traveltrust_onboarding_webhook_dlq_total`** (all DLQ rows incl. replayed — audit only).\n- **Optional recording rules**: **`ops/monitoring/prometheus-alerts-onboarding-webhook-queue.example.yml`** → group **`traveltrust_onboarding_http_recording`** (`traveltrust:onboarding_*_http_4xx_per_second_5m`, **`…quote…5xx…`**).\n- **Evidence**: **`cargo test -p traveltrust-api matrix_93_d_onb_011`** / **`matrix_93_d_onb_012`** — **[TT-9618 §3.6.1–§3.6.2](../../docs/runbook/TT-9618-onboarding-local-testnet.md)**, **[96-18-未完成 §4](../../docs/spec/96-18-未完成清单与多维检查.md#9618-cmd-cheatsheet)**.\n- **Import**: map Prometheus datasource **UID** to panels (placeholder **`prometheus`**).",
        "mode": "markdown"
